# Lychee ignore list — known false-positives or transient issues.
#
# Format: one URL pattern (regex) per line. See https://lychee.cli.rs/usage/config/
#
# Process for adding entries:
# 1. Run the weekly link-audit workflow (or lychee locally) and inspect failures.
# 2. For genuine false-positives (sites that block the checker, paywalls,
#    rate-limited-but-live, malformed-but-reachable), add a comment-justified entry.
# 3. For genuine dead links, prefer fixing the source over suppressing here.

# --- Valid links the checker can't fetch (sites up, but block bots / send
#     malformed responses / TLS quirks). Reviewed manually — keep the links. ---
eci\.gov\.in
ev\.delhi\.gov\.in
ocmms\.nic\.in
safar\.tropmet\.res\.in
main\.sci\.gov\.in
cpcb\.nic\.in

